<p>Iran’s Assembly of Experts has appointed Mojtaba Khamenei to succeed his father, Ayatollah Ali Khamenei, after the elder leader was reported killed in early U.S.-Israeli strikes. Much of the coverage framed the move as a bid for continuity and resolve as the war enters roughly its second week. Reporting also showed rallies in Tehran welcoming the new supreme leader, while analysts described the succession as further consolidating power among hardline clerical and security circles during active conflict. President Trump criticized the choice, saying he was “disappointed” and arguing it signaled “more of the same” for Iran. He declined to say whether the new leader had “a target on his back”. The leadership change came as the war’s spillover effects widened, with casualties rising and energy markets jolting; oil prices crossed $100 a barrel as fighting continued and worries about disruption grew. Several reports highlighted Mojtaba Khamenei’s relatively low public profile and the uncertainty of taking over in the middle of a high-stakes war. That makes his early decisions—on the battlefield and at home—especially consequential for Iran and the wider region.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/qeXVxGr-3u6ebR4jwBI1NoRvZuyJGtxM7CPrwkv7UB3ceKMd3sk4hA4M5Imfwls1Ugeuo8ynQU-7Tial5gb5ogeK8W-kQU_-JcjKfKePJHG5ceYNWwEbQyB-Y_9EXPtaACctZAi0nh5b6BDTUs34NzzOD1kJ7v-1vaqMmz8_BorBqO5Upi-XgA7dVFXCB7WIVrgVfwQzwGs' alt='People gather in Tehran carrying flags and posters of Mojtaba Khamenei.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Market spillover: Coverage linked the conflict to a broader risk-off shift, with stocks falling sharply in Asia ahead of expected losses when U.S. markets opened.</li><li>Shipping chokepoint: The Strait of Hormuz carries about a fifth of global oil and liquefied natural gas supplies, making markets especially sensitive to conflict-related shipping risks.</li></ul><blockquote>We think it’s going to lead to just more of the same problem for the country - President Donald Trump</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>President Donald Trump: He said he was “disappointed” by Mojtaba Khamenei’s appointment, called it likely “more of the same,” and declined to comment on whether the new leader was a potential target. (<a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/trump-says-he-disappointed-mojtaba-khamenei-became-irans-supreme-leader'>Al-Monitor</a>)</li><li>Iranian supporters in Tehran: Video coverage showed crowds rallying downtown to welcome Mojtaba Khamenei and signal support with flags and posters. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/3/10/iranians-rally-to-welcome-mojtaba-khamenei-as-new-supreme-leader'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li><li>NPR reporting: It described Mojtaba Khamenei as a low-profile figure long believed to wield influence behind the scenes, including in crackdowns on dissent and in shaping elections. (<a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/03/09/nx-s1-5742375/mojtaba-khamenei-iran-supreme-leader'>NPR</a>)</li><li>BBC analysis: It said the new leader has not been publicly tested in top office and now faces what it called an existential crisis for the Islamic Republic. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cwykdn0yn4wo'>BBC News</a>)</li><li>Christian Science Monitor analysis: It raised the question of whether Mojtaba Khamenei will govern confrontationally or try to broaden the regime’s internal support during wartime. (<a href='https://www.csmonitor.com/World/Middle-East/2026/0309/iran-war-ayatollah-khamenei-supreme-leader-succession'>The Christian Science Monitor</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/09/world/middleeast/iran-new-supreme-leader-mojtaba-khamenei.html'>Iran Choosing Mojtaba Khamenei as Supreme Leader Signals Defiance Amid War</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/trump-says-he-disappointed-mojtaba-khamenei-became-irans-supreme-leader'>Trump says he is &#x27;disappointed&#x27; that Mojtaba Khamenei became Iran&#x27;s supreme leader</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/3/10/iranians-rally-to-welcome-mojtaba-khamenei-as-new-supreme-leader'>Iranians rally to welcome Mojtaba Khamenei as new supreme leader</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/mojtaba-khamenei-iran-new-supreme-leader/article70720317.ece'>Iran picks Mojtaba Khamenei as new leader</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://theweek.com/world-news/iran-supreme-leader-ali-khamenei-son-mojtaba-oil-prices'>Iran names new leader as oil tops $100, deaths mount</a> - theweek.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/as-iran-war-deepens-khameneis-son-named-new-supreme-leader'>As Iran war deepens, Khamenei&#x27;s son named new supreme leader</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.allsides.com/news/2026-03-09-0700/middle-east-iran-appoints-ayatollahs-son-new-leader-us-and-israel-step-firepower-end-regime'>Iran Appoints Ayatollah&#x27;s Son as New Leader, US and Israel Step Up Firepower to End Regime</a> - allsides.com</li><li><a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/03/09/nx-s1-5742375/mojtaba-khamenei-iran-supreme-leader'>What to know about Mojtaba Khamenei, Iran&#x27;s new supreme leader</a> - npr.org</li><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1980326/trump-declines-to-say-if-irans-new-supreme-leader-has-target-on-his-back'>Trump declines to say if Iran’s new supreme leader has ‘target on his back’</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://www.csmonitor.com/World/Middle-East/2026/0309/iran-war-ayatollah-khamenei-supreme-leader-succession'>Signaling defiance, Iran’s regime rallies around a younger Khamenei</a> - csmonitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.firstpost.com/explainers/iran-mojtaba-khamenei-new-supreme-leader-us-israel-war-explained-13987725.html'>In Graphics: The rise of Mojtaba Khamenei, Iran’s new Supreme Leader</a> - firstpost.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cwykdn0yn4wo